{"b":"Child disability benefit","type":"Supplement (add-on)","typeD":["An extra amount added inside your CCB payment, not a separate payment. [@ccbAmt]"],"where":"Tax resident","whereD":["Same as the CCB: you must be eligible for the Canada child benefit for the child. [@newc]"],"good":[]},
